  {
   "index": 9,
   "tag": "blockquote",
   "landmarks": [
    "role=main"
   ],
   "textLength": 136,
   "text": "\"Pod Disruption\" is defined as:\nPod disruption is the process by which Pods on Nodes are terminated either voluntarily or involuntarily.",
